## User preferences

- When the user directly authorized “你把我电脑里那些360浏览器什么的全删掉行不行” and asked “再开一个终端”, perform a scoped 360 cleanup after co
nfirming executable identity and dependencies; provide a normal interactive terminal and keep the Codex terminal usable
