## User preferences

- The user corrected that merely operating the desktop client “没有意思” asking for “独立在后台运行、登录我本人账号的代理” -> prefer an indep
endent background service/API/session, not front-window automation or a separate bot identity. [Task 1]
- Restrict this kind of agent to the user's selected account/chat: the user designated only “河川的巨坑讨论群” for live validat
ion -> default all chats to off, avoid bulk enablement/broadcasts, and stop processing after the test. [Task 1][Task 3]

## Reusable knowledge

- Separate three authorities before implementation: message-platform account control, model authorization, and the user
's personal-account background session. A QQ/WeChat login does not grant ChatGPT model rights, and ChatGPT OAuth does n
ot grant QQ/WeChat history access. [Task 1]
- Sign in with ChatGPT uses OAuth with the public `https://api.openai.com/v1/responses` route (not private `backend-api
`); `store:false` and `stream:true` were used. OAuth does not import ChatGPT history/memory, so the app owns current co
nversation context. Do not infer commercial/multi-user hosting permission from local self-use/open-source documentation
. [Task 1]
- Core implementation: `outputs/background-agent/server.mjs`, `engine.mjs`, `public/app.js`, `work/qq-runtime/`, `work/
wechat-runtime/`, and `work/model-runtime/`. The local console at `127.0.0.1:17891` starts stopped; chats are off by de
fault; it supports drafts, mention-only group triggering, cancellation, account isolation, and no automatic retry after
 uncertain sends. [Task 2]
- Local boundary tests rejected foreign Host/Origin, cross-site image requests, state-changing requests with no Origin,
 abnormal paths, and private-file access. The WeChat adapter used its own browser profile, not the normal Chrome profil
e, UOS impersonation, anti-detection, client hooks, or downgrade. [Task 2]
- QQ verification was tripartite: model output (`connected/ready/sharing=true` and “后台模型连接成功。”); platform send (`stage=
finished`, `sendStatus=sent`, `eventsConnected=true`); remote group-history check (`remoteHistoryContainsTest=true`, me
ssage `589897133`). It ended with `enabled=false` and no other chat enabled. [Task 3]

## Failures and how to do differently

- Do not conflate a dedicated robot/ClawBot with a background agent acting as the user's ordinary personal account -> d
etermine identity and authorization boundaries first. [Task 1]
- WeChat `page.goto()` waiting for all resources produced `Navigation timeout of 60000 ms` -> use `domcontentloaded` an
d explicit QR/Angular state. QR display only proved `awaiting_user_scan`; after phone scan, `Request Error, Try Again, 
please`, `connected=false`, `account=null` prove WeChat was not connected. Do not claim success or bypass the rejection
 with hooks/downgrades. [Task 2]
- Model generation is not message delivery -> separately verify model result, send result, and platform-side historical
 message ID. [Task 3]

